7,"Bontok, Northern | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/rbk/?cf=1&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..tZ_baNR1OPijhBRf8cuGkg9l8QWTnLg8-HtxarBCK3I,Northern Bontok is an endangered indigenous language of the Philippines. It belongs to the Austronesian language family and is part of the Bontok macrolanguage. The language is used as a first language by older adults only.,"Bontok, Northern",Austronesian
